# Gitignored files a new worktree should start with, read by
# `wt step copy-ignored` (the pre-start hook in .config/wt.toml) and by
# Claude Code desktop's worktrees. Copies are APFS reflinks: instant, and no
# extra disk until one side writes.
#
# Deliberately short. Build/ and PacerCore/.build hold absolute paths to the
# checkout they were built in, so a copy is no faster than a clean build and can
# confuse Xcode. keys/ holds release credentials and must never be fanned out
# across worktrees.
Vendor/DuckDB.xcframework/
# The checkout's local Claude Code permission rules (gitignored by `.claude/*`).
# Without it, a session moved into a worktree loses every allow rule it had and
# gets blocked on commands it was already permitted to run. Permission rules
# only, no credentials.
.claude/settings.local.json
